# Lotusguard Disciple: the target may be a Vehicle even when it is not a creature (a Vehicle is only a creature while
# crewed, CR 301.7a, 702.122). Bot1 has Smuggler's Copter (an uncrewed artifact, not a creature) and three Moxes; the only
# legal targets for the Disciple's enter trigger are the Copter and the Disciple itself (the Moxes are neither creatures
# nor Vehicles, CR 115.2), and the Copter is chosen: it has lifelink and indestructible until end of turn (CR 611.2a).

